WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Hey Vicky, this is a video to thank you for the sound healing experience that you gave us a couple of days back.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
I must share with you that the experience was very very very deep.

00:12.000 --> 00:17.000
I didn't go into a very deep, extremely relaxed state.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
I really didn't want to open my eyes and come back.

00:22.000 --> 00:28.000
So thank you for the experience and I think for me the major shift, there was a shift that happened,

00:28.000 --> 00:31.000
which is apart from going deep.

00:31.000 --> 00:40.000
I think for me one of the shifts that I find after that sound healing session is the belief in self,

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
especially at a time that I've got so much to do.

00:44.000 --> 00:47.000
I think it's very common for us to have these questions.

00:47.000 --> 00:49.000
Will I be able to do it?

00:49.000 --> 00:51.000
How will I be able to do it?

00:51.000 --> 00:55.000
But for me the belief is back and I attribute it to your sound healing session.

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
Thank you so much and I really wish a lot more people experience your magic

01:00.000 --> 01:10.000
and in addition to the sound healing just your presence and the way you guide us through it is absolutely magical.

01:10.000 --> 01:12.000
Thank you so much.

